 { In the following example, Black was allowed to save himself by using Réti's idea. } 1. { -KEY- } Kc4 $2 { When playing so Yates must have overlooked Black's third move. } ( { With } 1. Qc2 $1 a3 ( { or } 1. Kc4 Ka3 2. Qb1 ) 
