b1=Q 2. Qxb1+ Kxb1 3. Kb4 Kb2 $1 { By means of the threat of 4...a3 Black gains a crucial tempo on his way to the white pawn. } ( 3... Kc2 $2 { failed to } 4. f4 ) 
4. Kxa4 Kc3 5. f4 Kd4 
